    <briefdescription>
<para>Runs a callable unconditionally when the guard goes out of scope. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The callable <computeroutput>F</computeroutput> must be noexcept-invocable; a <computeroutput>static_assert</computeroutput> enforces this at instantiation time. Copying is disabled so that the guard fires exactly once.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>F</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Callable type. Must satisfy <computeroutput>std::is_nothrow_invocable_v&lt;F &amp;&gt;</computeroutput>. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
